[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_WASTELAND_DEVELOP]
Wasteland Development

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_WASTELAND_DEVELOP_desc]
This region may be called wasteland for now, but construction, resources, tourism, and other value can still be developed here. What matters is how we use it.

Maybe there are §Ytreasures§! here.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_WASTELAND_DEVELOP]
开发区建设

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_WASTELAND_DEVELOP_desc]
虽然现在这片地区叫荒地，但这里也能开发出诸如建设、资源、旅游等价值，就看我们怎么利用它了。

说不定，这里有什么§Y宝藏§!呢？
